{"nodes": [{"id": "modpack_growyourownworld_varietystructureplan", "label": "Structure Variety Plan #68 (VARIETYSTRUCTUREPLAN)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "Modpack-growyourownworld/VARIETYSTRUCTUREPLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "modpack_growyourownworld_varietystructureplan_weighted_gate_engine", "label": "Weighted-gate structure-variety engine (rollRare)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "Modpack-growyourownworld/VARIETYSTRUCTUREPLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "rare_structure_chance present -> weighted pick over weight/requires/explorable fields + Lookup.modLoaded + Explore reward-floor filter; absent -> legacy byte-identical output. Backward-compatible opt-in. D3 Explore reward-floor: the premium seed never forces a loot-less build; D4: mod builds stay derelict so loot never leaks a gate-key (AE2 sky stone/presses, MA prosperity, Upgrade Orb). D5 large/huge rate settled = flat 5% on all sizes."}, {"id": "modpack_growyourownworld_varietystructureplan_inert_safe_gating", "label": "Inert-safe mod-gating pattern", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "Modpack-growyourownworld/VARIETYSTRUCTUREPLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Modded content is gated on Lookup.modLoaded / hasTemplatePool inert-guard and gametest-guarded so content stays inert (skips) when its mod is absent instead of hard-erroring; the void never generates anything on its own \u2014 every resource reaches the player only through a grown island seed."}, {"id": "modpack_growyourownworld_varietystructureplan_band4_epic_structures", "label": "Band 4 \u2014 grand epic structures (#74)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Modpack-growyourownworld/VARIETYSTRUCTUREPLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_u